{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill is published in "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", reducers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Installing-the-skill"},{"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope user","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (loads in every project).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope project","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pin a version with ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". List tags with ","type":"text"},{"code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Other agents: pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent codex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent cursor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", etc. Run ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh skill install --help","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the full list.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"skills.sh","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"skillssh"},{"code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".agents\/skills\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Pick the directory that matches your agent:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["# Claude Code — project install","mkdir -p .claude\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .claude\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref","","# Codex \/ Cursor \/ Gemini CLI — project install","mkdir -p .agents\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .agents\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swap "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".agents\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~\/.claude\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":" etc. for a user-wide install. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tar"},{"type":"text","text":" overwrites by default, so re-running either command updates the skill in place. To pin a version, replace "},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the URL with the tag name (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.0.0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Loading content directly (assistants without a skill loader)","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Loading-content-directly-assistants-without-a-skill-loader"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill files are plain Markdown. Point your assistant’s system prompt or rules file at:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/main\/swidux-ref\/SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/main\/swidux-ref\/swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}]},{"text":"What it helps with","type":"head